<html>
<head>
    <title>MCP Control Plane</title>
    <meta name="decorator" content="atl.admin"/>
    <meta name="admin.active.section" content="admin_plugins_menu/jim-admin-section"/>
    <meta name="admin.active.tab" content="jim-mcp-admin-link"/>
</head>
<body>
<div id="jim-mcp-admin">
    <h2>MCP Control Plane</h2>
    <p class="jim-mcp-sub">Administrative control plane for the Corbit Logic Jira MCP integration.
        Policy is enforced by the Corbit Logic Gateway; the raw MCP backend stays private.</p>

    <div id="jim-mcp-status" class="jim-mcp-card">Loading status&hellip;</div>

    <div class="jim-mcp-card">
        <h3>Global</h3>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="jim-mcp-enabled"/> MCP enabled</label>
            <span class="jim-mcp-classes">Classes:
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="jim-mcp-class-read"/> read</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="jim-mcp-class-write"/> write</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="jim-mcp-class-destructive"/> destructive</label>
            </span>
            <button class="aui-button" id="jim-mcp-save-global">Save global</button>
        </div>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <label>Allowed projects (CSV, empty = all):
                <input type="text" id="jim-mcp-projects" class="text" placeholder="MIT"/></label>
            <label>Gateway URL:
                <input type="text" id="jim-mcp-gwurl" class="text" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:9100"/></label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="jim-mcp-card">
        <h3>Tools</h3>
        <div class="jim-mcp-toolbar">
            <input type="text" id="jim-mcp-search" class="text" placeholder="Search tools&hellip;"/>
            <button class="aui-button" data-bulk="enable_all">Enable all</button>
            <button class="aui-button" data-bulk="disable_all">Disable all</button>
            <button class="aui-button" data-bulk="enable_read">Enable read</button>
            <button class="aui-button" data-bulk="enable_write">Enable write</button>
            <button class="aui-button" data-bulk="enable_destructive">Enable destructive</button>
        </div>
        <table class="aui" id="jim-mcp-tools">
            <thead><tr>
                <th>Tool</th><th>Toolset</th><th>Class</th><th>Verification</th>
                <th>Available</th><th>Enabled</th><th>Confirm</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="7">Loading&hellip;</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="jim-mcp-card">
        <h3>MCP Access &middot; دسترسی‌های MCP</h3>
        <p class="jim-mcp-sub">Per-user / per-group access presets. Enforced at tool execution by the Gateway
            (pulled automatically &mdash; no file editing). Tools always remain discoverable in the catalog;
            policy only decides execution. Presets: read_only, standard, full_controlled, blocked.</p>
        <div id="jim-acc-sync" class="jim-mcp-sub">&mdash;</div>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <label>Global mode:
                <select id="jim-acc-mode" class="select">
                    <option value="all">all</option>
                    <option value="allowlist">allowlist</option>
                    <option value="disabled">disabled</option>
                </select></label>
            <label>Default preset:
                <select id="jim-acc-default" class="select">
                    <option value="read_only">read_only</option>
                    <option value="standard">standard</option>
                    <option value="full_controlled">full_controlled</option>
                    <option value="blocked">blocked</option>
                </select></label>
        </div>

        <h4>Users</h4>
        <table class="aui" id="jim-acc-users">
            <thead><tr><th>Jira user key</th><th>Preset</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="3">Loading&hellip;</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <input type="text" id="jim-acc-user-key" class="text" placeholder="JIRAUSER10000"/>
            <select id="jim-acc-user-preset" class="select">
                <option value="read_only">read_only</option><option value="standard">standard</option>
                <option value="full_controlled">full_controlled</option><option value="blocked">blocked</option>
            </select>
            <button class="aui-button" id="jim-acc-user-add">Add / update user</button>
        </div>

        <h4>Groups</h4>
        <table class="aui" id="jim-acc-groups">
            <thead><tr><th>Jira group</th><th>Preset</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="3">&mdash;</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <input type="text" id="jim-acc-group-name" class="text" placeholder="jira-developers"/>
            <select id="jim-acc-group-preset" class="select">
                <option value="read_only">read_only</option><option value="standard">standard</option>
                <option value="full_controlled">full_controlled</option><option value="blocked">blocked</option>
            </select>
            <button class="aui-button" id="jim-acc-group-add">Add / update group</button>
        </div>

        <h4>Project restrictions</h4>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <label>Mode:
                <select id="jim-acc-proj-mode" class="select">
                    <option value="jira">jira (native permissions only)</option>
                    <option value="restrict">restrict to listed</option>
                    <option value="block">block listed</option>
                </select></label>
            <label>Projects (CSV):
                <input type="text" id="jim-acc-proj-list" class="text" placeholder="MIT,COR"/></label>
        </div>

        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <button class="aui-button aui-button-primary" id="jim-acc-apply">Apply access policy</button>
            <span id="jim-acc-apply-msg"></span>
        </div>

        <h4>Effective-access simulator</h4>
        <p class="jim-mcp-sub">Preview the decision for a user/tool without executing it. Jira/plugin permissions
            are additionally enforced at execution.</p>
        <div class="jim-mcp-global-controls">
            <input type="text" id="jim-acc-sim-user" class="text" placeholder="JIRAUSER10000"/>
            <input type="text" id="jim-acc-sim-tool" class="text" placeholder="corbit_chat_execute_multi_send"/>
            <button class="aui-button" id="jim-acc-sim-run">Simulate</button>
        </div>
        <div id="jim-acc-sim-result">&mdash;</div>
    </div>

    <div class="jim-mcp-card">
        <h3>Diagnostics</h3>
        <div id="jim-mcp-diag">&mdash;</div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
